   "line": [
    "c4"
   ],
   "spoken": "c4 — the Maroczy Bind, the biggest reason the Accelerated Dragon isn't more popular at GM level. At lower levels it isn't scary: it demands very positional play, and Black has tricky responses most players under 2200 don't know — miss them and White's center can collapse."
