    "d6",
    "Qc5",
    "dxe5",
    "Qxe5"
   ],
   "spoken": "This is still equal, but White has to play like an engine; practically Black is doing great — the more common queen recapture opens the center with White's queen vulnerable, and our next move is to castle.",
